{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A change applied when normalizing a "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to canonical form."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Change"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Two of these fire far less often than they used to","anchor":"Two-of-these-fire-far-less-often-than-they-used-to"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before the typed tag model, normalization was where a tag’s name and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"its parameter names were put right, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/canonicalizedTagName(_:_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/Change\/renamedParameter(_:_:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"were reported for ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"every"}]},{"text":" tag written with an alias or a deprecated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter name. They are now reported only for a tag that failed to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"promote to a typed payload.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The canonicalization still happens either way — it just usually"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"happens in the parser, where promotion selects the payload and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"payload ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"text":" the canonical identity. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\bm"},{"type":"text","text":" becomes a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNBeam","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reports the name "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beam"},{"type":"text","text":"; there was never an alias"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stored to rewrite. Only a tag promotion rejected — an unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter, a value no field can carry — keeps its written name far"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enough downstream for the normalizer’s fallback table to be the thing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that fixes it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"So a caller that counted these changes to detect “this score used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"short-form tag names” will now see nothing for a score it previously"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"reported on. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The formatted output is unchanged","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": a "},{"code":"\\bm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"comes out ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\beam"},{"text":". What changed is which stage says so, and therefore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether it is announced at all.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Change","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"